A caret line does not end a paragraph it cannot caption

```
Text
^ Figure 1: moon
.
<p>Text
^ Figure 1: moon</p>
```

```
Text
![Apollo](a.jpg)
^ Figure 1: moon
.
<p>Text
<img src="a.jpg" alt="Apollo">
^ Figure 1: moon</p>
```

```
> Text
> ^ Figure 1: moon
.
<blockquote><p>Text
^ Figure 1: moon</p></blockquote>
```
